OL,3,GNEWSAHomes and golf club without power
OL,4,Aafter workshop fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of residents woke up to a
OL,7,Fpower cut after fire damaged overhead
OL,8,Fpower cables.
OL,10,FFire crews were called to Burton Road,
OL,11,Fnear Bridport, Dorset, shortly after
OL,12,F05:00 BST, where a private workshop was
OL,13,Falight.
OL,15,FNational Grid said power had been
OL,16,Frestored to 401 properties but 20
OL,17,Fremained without electricity.
OL,19,FAmong them is Bridport and West Dorset
OL,20,FGolf Club, which said it would remain
OL,21,Fclosed for the rest of the day.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
